# Jira bug requests

When the user asks to **create a Jira bug**, **file a bug**, **report a test failure in Jira**, or similar:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/jira-bug-reporter/SKILL.md` completely (investigate artifacts, structured description, link to story, attach screenshots).
2. Do not skip the skill in favor of ad-hoc Jira creation.
3. Do not auto-fix tests or product code unless the user explicitly asks separately.
